<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Pilecon 6-month net up 55 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Pilecon 6-month net up 55 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	5.6    vs	   3.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		   346.95   vs	 283.04</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    23.92   vs	  17.89</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  4.32   vs  less   3.51</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   47.81   vs	    -</p>
<p>    Net profit		  11.27   vs	   7.26</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)     10.0    vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Pilecon is involved in engineering and property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
